    "Html": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sweet potatoes are one of my favorite vegetables and a delicious way for me to tick off the “other vegetables” boxes on my </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/topics/daily-dozen/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Daily Dozen</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> checklist.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">What has the latest research on their benefits found? What is the best way to cook them? This infographic summarizes the main takeaways and features some simple recipes. </span></p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-94435 size-full\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/05/sweet-potato-infographic-en-1.jpg\" alt=\"benefits of sweet potato infographic\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1572\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/05/sweet-potato-infographic-en-1.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/05/sweet-potato-infographic-en-1-960x1258.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/05/sweet-potato-infographic-en-1-1024x1341.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/05/sweet-potato-infographic-en-1-768x1006.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/05/sweet-potato-infographic-en-1-1173x1536.jpg 1173w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/05/sweet-potato-infographic-en-1-720x943.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/05/sweet-potato-infographic-en-1-540x707.jpg 540w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\"/></p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-94437 size-full\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/05/sweet-potato-infographic-en-2.jpg\" alt=\"benefits of sweet potato infographic\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1528\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/05/sweet-potato-infographic-en-2.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/05/sweet-potato-infographic-en-2-960x1222.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/05/sweet-potato-infographic-en-2-1024x1304.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/05/sweet-potato-infographic-en-2-768x978.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/05/sweet-potato-infographic-en-2-720x917.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/05/sweet-potato-infographic-en-2-540x688.jpg 540w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\"/></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Get this infographic as a PDF </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.box.com/s/rbkej9evdfisnyiqil47y85zaej8e892\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">here</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">For more details about these studies, watch the free videos on the NutritionFacts.org’s </span><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/user/NutritionFactsOrg\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">YouTube channel</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> or on the website’s sweet potato</span> <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/topics/sweet-potatoes/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">topic page</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.</span></p>"
